  /// 1C-13: deterministic per-logical-shipment reference sent to the provider
  /// (Pathao merchant_order_id / RedX merchant_invoice_id / Steadfast invoice).
  /// Format: "<vendorOrderId>-<warehouseId>" (re-bookings add an attempt
